From: aiden build <build@aiden.local>
Subject: [PATCH] adb: restore mDNS transport discovery in main.cpp

Re-enable init_mdns_transport_discovery() that nmeum's 0002 patch removed.
Gated on ADB_MDNS env (set to 0 to disable), matching upstream AOSP.

Aiden-local patch (re-enables mDNS that nmeum disabled for the client).
---
--- a/vendor/core/adb/client/main.cpp
+++ b/vendor/core/adb/client/main.cpp
@@ -126,6 +126,9 @@
     init_reconnect_handler();
 
     adb_wifi_init();
+    if (!getenv("ADB_MDNS") || strcmp(getenv("ADB_MDNS"), "0") != 0) {
+        init_mdns_transport_discovery();
+    }
 
     if (!getenv("ADB_USB") || strcmp(getenv("ADB_USB"), "0") != 0) {
         usb_init();
